{"version":1,"content":"<p>【預防 ⚠️】由於兩個 CVSS v4.0 評分高達 9.2 的 PHP 重大漏洞被提早外洩，歐洲多國政府機關及公共服務採取罕見預防措施，在 PHP 緊急安全修補程式上線前，主動將多個對外官方網站與線上系統離線，以降低潛在網絡安全風險。</p><p>官方強調此舉純屬主動防範，「Cut Here to activate the firewall」才是最強的網絡防禦。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T16:40:40.412371+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:22:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T19:37:37.726170+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T16:37:41.596892+00:00","content_hash":"f184f08ab6043353675564a1540128345fba9f5be50f0ebd935c0624501a0172","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}